      "mergedPostDetails": "What device are you using?\n\nIPhone 14\n\nWhat iOS version is installed?\n\n17.5.1\n\nWhat VRChat Build Number is installed? (You can find this in Testflight)\n\n2024.2.3 (333)\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nWhen creating an instance from the opening menu, the Region doesn't save as it would when creating an instance while in a world. If I were to make a new instance while in a world it would default to US East.\n\nWhat do you expected to happen?\n\nThe Region would save to the last region you used\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nThe Region defaults to US West",
