  "details": "Please keep the region which was selected at the last time.\n\nIt would be the best that it's synced with in-game selected region.\n\nHow to reproduce:\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Choose a world\n\n3. Create a new instance in a region other than USW, then join to it.\n\n4. Exit from VRChat by in-game MM.\n\n5. Try to create another instance, but USW region is selected. (Step 3's region is expected)\n\nEnvironments:\n\n- VRChat beta 2024.2.3(333)\n\n- iOS 17.5.1\n\n- iPhone 14 Pro",
